SUMMARY:🌊 White Cliffs of Dover (not final)
LOCATION:White Cliffs of Dover Visitor Centre\, Langdon Cliffs\, CT16 1HJ
DESCRIPTION:With Sashi and Laura. 09:00 leave Bromley (~1h30). Parking £6 
 (NT members free)\, gates lock 19:00. Cliff-top walk to South Foreland Lig
 hthouse\, ~55 min each way. Proper shoes + windproof layer.\nHeavy rain: C
 anterbury only instead (leave ~10:00\, cathedral 11:15).\nMap: https://map
 s.google.com/?q=White+Cliffs+of+Dover+Visitor+Centre
TRANSP:OPAQUE
